<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>ColorJoy Kids — Playful Coloring Book &amp; Studio</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fredoka:wght@500;600;700&family=Nunito:wght@500;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #fff9ec;
      --surface: #ffffff;
      --surface-alt: #f8fafc;
      --hero-inner: #f0f9ff;
      --ink: #232946;
      --border-color: #232946;
      --muted: #5c6482;
      --pink: #ff5d8f;
      --yellow: #ffd166;
      --mint: #06d6a0;
      --sky: #4cc9f0;
      --purple: #9b5de5;
      --orange: #ff9f1c;
      --dot-a: #ffd16655;
      --dot-b: #4cc9f044;
      --header-bg: rgba(255, 249, 236, 0.92);
      --border: 3px solid var(--border-color);
      --shadow: 5px 5px 0px var(--border-color);
      --shadow-sm: 3px 3px 0px var(--border-color);
      --radius: 22px;
    }

    body.night-mode {
      --bg: #171928;
      --surface: #23263d;
      --surface-alt: #1d2033;
      --hero-inner: #2b304d;
      --ink: #f8f9ff;
      --border-color: #ffd166;
      --muted: #b8c0e0;
      --dot-a: #ffd16618;
      --dot-b: #9b5de522;
      --header-bg: rgba(23, 25, 40, 0.92);
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      font-family: 'Nunito', sans-serif;
      background-color: var(--bg);
      background-image:
        radial-gradient(var(--dot-a) 2px, transparent 2px),
        radial-gradient(var(--dot-b) 2px, transparent 2px);
      background-size: 36px 36px;
      background-position: 0 0, 18px 18px;
      color: var(--ink);
      line-height: 1.5;
      transition: background-color 0.25s ease, color 0.25s ease;
    }

    h1, h2, h3, .brand-font {
      font-family: 'Fredoka', sans-serif;
      letter-spacing: 0.3px;
    }

    .container {
      width: min(1140px, 92%);
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    /* Navbar */
    header {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 50;
      background: var(--header-bg);
      backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
      border-bottom: var(--border);
    }

    .nav {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 14px 0;
      gap: 14px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .logo {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: var(--ink);
      font-family: 'Fredoka', sans-serif;
      font-size: 1.55rem;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    .logo-badge {
      width: 42px;
      height: 42px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      background: var(--yellow);
      border: var(--border);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      font-size: 1.3rem;
      color: #232946;
    }

    .nav-links {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    .nav-links a {
      text-decoration: none;
      color: var(--ink);
      font-weight: 800;
      padding: 8px 12px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      transition: transform 0.15s ease, background 0.15s ease, color 0.15s ease;
    }

    .nav-links a:hover {
      background: var(--yellow);
      color: #232946;
      transform: translateY(-2px);
    }

    .btn {
      font-family: 'Fredoka', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 600;
      font-size: 0.98rem;
      border: var(--border);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 10px 18px;
      cursor: pointer;
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      text-decoration: none;
      color: #232946;
      background: #ffffff;
      transition: transform 0.12s ease, box-shadow 0.12s ease, background 0.12s ease;
    }

    .btn:hover {
      transform: translate(-1px, -1px);
      box-shadow: 4px 4px 0px var(--border-color);
    }

    .btn:active {
      transform: translate(2px, 2px);
      box-shadow: 1px 1px 0px var(--border-color);
    }

    .btn.active-tool {
      background: var(--purple);
      color: #fff;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      background: var(--pink);
      color: #fff;
    }

    .btn-mint {
      background: var(--mint);
    }

    .btn-sky {
      background: var(--sky);
    }

    .btn-yellow {
      background: var(--yellow);
    }

    .btn-sm {
      padding: 7px 12px;
      font-size: 0.86rem;
      border-radius: 12px;
    }

    /* Hero */
    .hero {
      padding: 46px 0 36px;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1.15fr 0.85fr;
      gap: 32px;
      align-items: center;
    }

    .pill {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
      background: var(--mint);
      color: #232946;
      border: var(--border);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      padding: 6px 14px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 0.88rem;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .hero h1 {
      font-size: clamp(2.3rem, 5vw, 3.65rem);
      line-height: 1.1;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .hero h1 span.highlight-pink {
      color: var(--pink);
      text-decoration: underline wavy var(--yellow) 4px;
      text-underline-offset: 6px;
    }

    .hero p {
      font-size: 1.1rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-weight: 700;
      margin-bottom: 24px;
      max-width: 54ch;
    }

    .hero-actions {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .hero-card {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: var(--border);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 20px;
      position: relative;
      transform: rotate(1.5deg);
    }

    .hero-card-inner {
      background: var(--hero-inner);
      border: 2.5px dashed var(--border-color);
      border-radius: 16px;
      padding: 18px;
      text-align: center;
    }

    .floating-sticker {
      position: absolute;
      top: -16px;
      right: -14px;
      background: var(--yellow);
      color: #232946;
      border: var(--border);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      border-radius: 999px;
      padding: 8px 14px;
      font-family: 'Fredoka', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 700;
      transform: rotate(10deg);
    }

    /* Section Headings */
    .section-header {
      text-align: center;
      margin: 44px auto 24px;
      max-width: 660px;
    }

    .section-header h2 {
      font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 3.5vw, 2.5rem);
      margin-bottom: 8px;
    }

    .section-header p {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    /* Coloring Pages Grid */
    .pages-grid, .gallery-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(230px, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 42px;
    }

    .page-card, .gallery-card {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: var(--border);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 16px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
      transition: transform 0.15s ease;
    }

    .page-card:hover, .gallery-card:hover {
      transform: translateY(-4px);
    }

    .page-card.active-page {
      outline: 4px solid var(--pink);
    }

    .thumb-box {
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 2px solid #232946;
      border-radius: 16px;
      height: 150px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      padding: 8px;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .page-meta {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .tag {
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      padding: 4px 10px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 2px solid #232946;
      background: var(--yellow);
      color: #232946;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    /* Interactive Studio */
    .studio {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: var(--border);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      border-radius: 28px;
      padding: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 54px;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }

    .studio-top {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
      padding-bottom: 18px;
      border-bottom: 2px dashed var(--muted);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .studio-layout {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 285px 1fr;
      gap: 24px;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .toolbar {
      background: var(--bg);
      border: var(--border);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 16px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .tool-label {
      font-family: 'Fredoka', sans-serif;
      font-size: 1rem;
      margin-bottom: 8px;
      display: block;
    }

    .palette {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .swatch {
      width: 100%;
      aspect-ratio: 1;
      border-radius: 50%;
      border: 3px solid var(--border-color);
      cursor: pointer;
      transition: transform 0.12s ease, box-shadow 0.12s ease;
    }

    .swatch.rainbow-swatch {
      background: conic-gradient(#ff5d8f, #ff9f1c, #ffd166, #06d6a0, #4cc9f0, #9b5de5, #ff5d8f);
    }

    .swatch:hover {
      transform: scale(1.08);
    }

    .swatch.selected {
      transform: scale(1.14);
      box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px var(--surface), 0 0 0 6px var(--border-color);
    }

    .custom-color-row {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 10px;
      margin-top: 10px;
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 2px solid var(--border-color);
      border-radius: 12px;
      padding: 6px 10px;
      font-weight: 800;
      font-size: 0.88rem;
    }

    .custom-color-row input[type="color"] {
      width: 36px;
      height: 30px;
      border: 2px solid #232946;
      border-radius: 8px;
      background: none;
      cursor: pointer;
      padding: 0;
    }

    .size-options, .sticker-options {
      display: flex;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .size-btn, .sticker-btn {
      flex: 1;
      padding: 8px 6px;
      border-radius: 12px;
      border: 2px solid var(--border-color);
      background: #fff;
      color: #232946;
      font-weight: 800;
      cursor: pointer;
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      transition: transform 0.1s ease;
    }

    .sticker-btn {
      font-size: 1.25rem;
      padding: 6px;
    }

    .size-btn.active, .sticker-btn.active {
      background: var(--sky);
      transform: scale(1.05);
    }

    .tool-actions {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .tool-actions .btn {
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 9px 10px;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
    }

    .canvas-stage {
      background: var(--surface-alt);
      border: var(--border);
      border-radius: 20px;
      padding: 16px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
    }

    .canvas-frame {
      position: relative;
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 560px;
      aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
      background: #ffffff;
      border: 3px solid var(--border-color);
      border-radius: 16px;
      overflow: hidden;
      touch-action: none;
    }

    canvas {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      display: block;
    }

    #paintCanvas {
      z-index: 1;
      cursor: crosshair;
    }

    #paintCanvas.bucket-cursor {
      cursor: cell;
    }

    #paintCanvas.sticker-cursor {
      cursor: copy;
    }

    #lineArtCanvas {
      z-index: 2;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    #confettiCanvas {
      position: fixed;
      inset: 0;
      width: 100vw;
      height: 100vh;
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 100;
    }

    .hint {
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-weight: 700;
      text-align: center;
    }

    /* Gallery Empty State */
    .empty-gallery {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: 3px dashed var(--border-color);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 32px 20px;
      text-align: center;
      color: var(--muted);
      font-weight: 800;
      margin-bottom: 46px;
    }

    .gallery-actions {
      display: flex;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .gallery-actions .btn {
      flex: 1;
      justify-content: center;
    }

    /* Perks / Features */
    .features-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr));
      gap: 20px;
      margin-bottom: 50px;
    }

    .feature-box {
      background: var(--surface);
      border: var(--border);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow-sm);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 20px;
    }

    .feature-icon {
      width: 48px;
      height: 48px;
      border-radius: 14px;
      border: 2.5px solid #232946;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      font-size: 1.4rem;
      margin-bottom: 12px;
      color: #232946;
    }

    footer {
      background: #121420;
      color: #fff;
      border-top: var(--border);
      padding: 28px 0;
      text-align: center;
      font-weight: 700;
    }

    @media print {
      body * {
        visibility: hidden;
      }
      .canvas-frame, .canvas-frame * {
        visibility: visible;
      }
      .canvas-frame {
        position: fixed;
        left: 50%;
        top: 50%;
        transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
        width: 90vw;
        max-width: none;
        aspect-ratio: 4 / 3;
        box-shadow: none;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 860px) {
      .hero {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
      .studio-layout {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <canvas id="confettiCanvas"></canvas>

  <header>
    <div class="container nav">
      <a href="#" class="logo">
        <span class="logo-badge">🖍️</span>
        <span>ColorJoy Kids</span>
      </a>
      <nav class="nav-links">
        <a href="#pages">9 Pages</a>
        <a href="#studio">Studio</a>
        <a href="#gallery">My Gallery</a>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-sm" id="nightModeBtn" title="Toggle Cozy Night Mode">🌙 Night Mode</button>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-yellow btn-sm" id="soundToggleBtn" title="Toggle Fun Sounds">🔊 Sound: ON</button>
        <a href="#studio" class="btn btn-primary btn-sm">Start Coloring</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="container">
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="hero">
      <div>
        <div class="pill">✨ Kid-Safe Digital &amp; Printable Coloring Book</div>
        <h1>Big Smiles &amp; <span class="highlight-pink">Bright Colors</span> for Little Artists</h1>
        <p>
          Pick from 8 outlines or a blank free-draw canvas, paint with custom or rainbow colors,
          stamp fun stickers, and save your masterpieces to your personal gallery!
        </p>
        <div class="hero-actions">
          <a href="#studio" class="btn btn-primary">🎨 Open Coloring Studio</a>
          <a href="#gallery" class="btn btn-mint">🖼️ View My Gallery</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-card">
        <div class="floating-sticker">Free-Draw + Night Mode ★</div>
        <div class="hero-card-inner">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 320 210" width="100%" height="auto" aria-label="Cheerful rocket and sun illustration">
            <rect x="0" y="0" width="320" height="210" rx="14" fill="#ffffff" />
            <circle cx="265" cy="48" r="24" fill="#ffd166" stroke="#232946" stroke-width="3" />
            <circle cx="52" cy="42" r="5" fill="#4cc9f0" />
            <circle cx="130" cy="30" r="4" fill="#ff5d8f" />
            <circle cx="205" cy="36" r="5" fill="#06d6a0" />
            <path d="M160 32 C192 65, 194 115, 182 145 L138 145 C126 115, 128 65, 160 32 Z" fill="#ff5d8f" stroke="#232946" stroke-width="3.5" />
            <circle cx="160" cy="88" r="17" fill="#4cc9f0" stroke="#232946" stroke-width="3.5" />
            <path d="M138 118 L112 142 L134 145 Z" fill="#ffd166" stroke="#232946" stroke-width="3.5" />
            <path d="M182 118 L208 142 L186 145 Z" fill="#ffd166" stroke="#232946" stroke-width="3.5" />
            <path d="M146 145 Q160 185 174 145 Z" fill="#ff9f1c" stroke="#232946" stroke-width="3.5" />
          </svg>
          <p style="margin: 8px 0 0; font-family: 'Fredoka', sans-serif; color: var(--ink);">
            Tap any page or the Blank Canvas below to begin!
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Coloring Pages Picker -->
    <section id="pages">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Choose a Page or Blank Canvas</h2>
        <p>Eight bold-outline pictures plus a wide-open Blank Free-Draw sheet for original creations.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pages-grid" id="pagesGrid"></div>
    </section>

    <!-- Interactive Coloring Studio -->
    <section id="studio" class="studio">
      <div class="studio-top">
        <div>
          <h2 id="activePageTitle">Page: Happy Rocket Ship</h2>
          <p id="toolStatusText" style="color: var(--muted); font-weight: 700;">
            Active Tool: Brush — Drag to color inside or outside the lines!
          </p>
        </div>
        <div style="display: flex; gap: 10px; flex-wrap: wrap;">
          <button type="button" class="btn btn-sky" id="printBtn">🖨️ Print Sheet</button>
          <button type="button" class="btn btn-yellow" id="saveGalleryBtn">🖼️ Save to Gallery</button>
          <button type="button" class="btn btn-mint" id="downloadBtn">🎉 Download PNG</button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="studio-layout">
        <aside class="toolbar">
          <div>
            <span class="tool-label">1. Pick a Color (or Rainbow!)</span>
            <div class="palette" id="palette"></div>
            <label class="custom-color-row" for="customColorInput">
              <span>🎨 Custom Color Wheel</span>
              <input type="color" id="customColorInput" value="#ff5d8f" title="Pick any custom color" />
            </label>
          </div>

          <div>
            <span class="tool-label">2. Brush / Stamp Size</span>
            <div class="size-options">
              <button type="button" class="size-btn" data-size="10">Small</button>
              <button type="button" class="size-btn active" data-size="20">Medium</button>
              <button type="button" class="size-btn" data-size="36">Big</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div>
            <span class="tool-label">3. Fun Stickers (Tap Canvas)</span>
            <div class="sticker-options">
              <button type="button" class="sticker-btn" data-sticker="⭐" title="Star Stamp">⭐</button>
              <button type="button" class="sticker-btn" data-sticker="❤️" title="Heart Stamp">❤️</button>
              <button type="button" class="sticker-btn" data-sticker="😊" title="Smiley Stamp">😊</button>
              <button type="button" class="sticker-btn" data-sticker="🌸" title="Flower Stamp">🌸</button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div>
            <span class="tool-label">4. Tools</span>
            <div class="tool-actions">
              <button type="button" class="btn btn-sky" id="brushBtn">🖌️ Brush</button>
              <button type="button" class="btn btn-yellow" id="bucketBtn">🪣 Fill</button>
              <button type="button" class="btn" id="eraserBtn">🧽 Eraser</button>
              <button type="button" class="btn" id="undoBtn">↩️ Undo</button>
              <button type="button" class="btn" id="clearBtn" style="grid-column: span 2; background: #ffe5ec;">
                🗑️ Clear Colors
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>
        </aside>

        <div class="canvas-stage">
          <div class="canvas-frame">
            <canvas id="paintCanvas" width="800" height="600"></canvas>
            <canvas id="lineArtCanvas" width="800" height="600"></canvas>
          </div>
          <p class="hint">
            Tip: Click <strong>🖼️ Save to Gallery</strong> to keep your artwork on this device, or switch to <strong>🌙 Night Mode</strong> for evening play!
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- My Saved Gallery Section -->
    <section id="gallery">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>My Saved Art Gallery</h2>
        <p>Your saved drawings stay right here in your browser so you can admire or continue coloring them anytime.</p>
      </div>
      <div id="galleryContainer"></div>
    </section>

    <!-- Features Section -->
    <section id="why-us">
      <div class="section-header">
        <h2>Everything Little Artists Love</h2>
        <p>Creative tools designed for fun, imagination, and screen-smart play.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="features-grid">
        <div class="feature-box">
          <div class="feature-icon" style="background: var(--yellow);">🎨</div>
          <h3>Blank Free-Draw &amp; Custom Colors</h3>
          <p style="color: var(--muted); font-weight: 700;">Start from a clean sketchpad and mix any custom shade using the color wheel.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-box">
          <div class="feature-icon" style="background: var(--mint);">🖼️</div>
          <h3>Personal Art Gallery</h3>
          <p style="color: var(--muted); font-weight: 700;">Save finished masterpieces locally and reload them onto the studio canvas whenever you want.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-box">
          <div class="feature-icon" style="background: var(--sky);">🌙</div>
          <h3>Cozy Bedtime Night Mode</h3>
          <p style="color: var(--muted); font-weight: 700;">Soft twilight colors reduce glare during quiet evening coloring sessions.</p>
        </div>
